  "headline": "Prabowo Subianto Nominates Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono for VP",
  "seoTitle": "Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono Nominated as VP by Prabowo",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto has submitted Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono as vice president candidates to replace Gibran Rakabuming Raka.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto officially proposed Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono as new vice president candidates to replace Gibran Rakabuming Raka.",
    "The MPR is conducting a verification process, including background checks, health examinations, and school document validation, ahead of an election on December 11.",
    "Officials confirmed that both candidates may remain in their respective ministerial positions within the Red and White Cabinet during the nomination phase."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Following the vacancy of the vice presidency previously held by Gibran Rakabuming Raka, President Prabowo Subianto has formally nominated two candidates, Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono, to the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR). The nomination process has triggered a rigorous verification stage, which involves the MPR conducting direct checks on the candidates' educational documents and medical health. According to the MPR, these procedures are scheduled to conclude by December 1, 2026, leading to a final selection in a plenary session on December 11, 2026. The candidates, who currently serve as the Minister of Agriculture and the Coordinating Minister for Human Development and Cultural Affairs, are not required to resign from their cabinet roles during the vetting process. Media reports have highlighted the public disclosure of their personal wealth records as part of the broader administrative scrutiny surrounding their selection.",
